  obtain ⟨⟨a1, h1⟩, ⟨a2, h2⟩, ⟨a3, h3⟩, ⟨a4, h4⟩, ⟨a5, h5⟩, ⟨a6, h6⟩, ⟨a7, h7⟩, ⟨a8, h8⟩,
